Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:03:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Canvas: page frame column numbers and title block

Column numbers 1..columns run along the top and bottom margins on the same
grid as PageFormat::column_at. A title block in the bottom-right shows the
project name, page name and title, sheet n of m and the page's structure.
The frame redraws on project info changes and whenever any page is added,
removed or changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
